    "detailed_description": "<strong>This is a point-and-click adventure game where you go on an adventure with the cat Emma!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><br><strong>[exciting adventure story]</strong><br>A well-structured and exciting adventure story organized by episode awaits you.<br>Go on an adventure with Emma and uncover her secrets.<br><br><strong>[Beautiful backgrounds and attractive NPCs]</strong><br>Visit many beautiful locations with Emma and make a variety of friends.<br><br><strong>[Character Animation]</strong><br>All actions of Emma and NPCs have been animated.<br><br><strong>[Intuitive puzzle construction through item use and combination]</strong><br>We did not include puzzles for the sake of random puzzles that force longer play time.<br>Use and combine the necessary items to unfold the story.<br><br><strong>[Ability to display interactable objects]</strong><br>Anyone who has played point-and-click adventure games will empathize with the frustration of repeatedly clicking the mouse all over the screen to find interactive objects.<br>In order to reduce unnecessary repetitive clicking, this game has been designed to intuitively check the location of objects that can be interacted with through a 'search function'.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>This is a point-and-click adventure game where you go on an adventure with the cat Emma!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><br><strong>[exciting adventure story]</strong><br>A well-structured and exciting adventure story organized by episode awaits you.<br>Go on an adventure with Emma and uncover her secrets.<br><br><strong>[Beautiful backgrounds and attractive NPCs]</strong><br>Visit many beautiful locations with Emma and make a variety of friends.<br><br><strong>[Character Animation]</strong><br>All actions of Emma and NPCs have been animated.<br><br><strong>[Intuitive puzzle construction through item use and combination]</strong><br>We did not include puzzles for the sake of random puzzles that force longer play time.<br>Use and combine the necessary items to unfold the story.<br><br><strong>[Ability to display interactable objects]</strong><br>Anyone who has played point-and-click adventure games will empathize with the frustration of repeatedly clicking the mouse all over the screen to find interactive objects.<br>In order to reduce unnecessary repetitive clicking, this game has been designed to intuitively check the location of objects that can be interacted with through a 'search function'.",
